{"questions":[{"id":"Q163","typeId":"月曆方格","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S11:p1","S12:p4"],"prompt":"月曆上相鄰兩天為a與a+1，其正下方是a+7與a+8，四日日期合計84。最早日期為幾日？","answer":"17","explanation":"4a+16＝84，a＝17；最晚25日有效。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"4*x+16=84","root":"17","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"19.5","misconception":"把四格日期當成四個連續日，誤列4a+6＝84；跨列應相差7。"},{"id":"c2","text":"21","misconception":"只用84除以4，得到四日期平均值；最早日期比平均早4日。"},{"id":"c3","text":"17"},{"id":"c4","text":"19","misconception":"把正下方日期差誤當3天，誤列a、a+1、a+3、a+4。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q166","typeId":"比例宣傳判讀","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S07:p2"],"prompt":"濾網阻隔率定義為(k−1)/k。k從20升至40，廠商說阻隔率變成2倍。下列哪一組判斷及兩次阻隔率完全正確？","answer":"不合理","explanation":"分別95%與97.5%，97.5%不是95%的2倍。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":null,"root":null,"domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c2","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"合理；原阻隔率95%，新阻隔率97.5%，所以變成2倍","misconception":"兩個阻隔率算對，但97.5÷95並不等於2；參數倍增不代表比率倍增。"},{"id":"c2","text":"不合理；原阻隔率95%，新阻隔率97.5%，未變成2倍"},{"id":"c3","text":"不合理；原阻隔率5%，新阻隔率2.5%，變成一半","misconception":"算到的是1/k漏過率，題目比較阻隔率，應各用1減去它。"},{"id":"c4","text":"合理；原阻隔率95%，新阻隔率190%，確實加倍","misconception":"直接將95%乘2，未代入(k−1)/k；阻隔率亦不能超過100%。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","category":"解一元一次方程式"},{"id":"Q171","typeId":"新運算定義","difficulty":"中","sourceRefs":["S11:p2"],"prompt":"定義 [a,b;c,d]＝ad−bc。若 [5,x;3,−2]＝−31，求x。","answer":"7","explanation":"5×(−2)−3x＝−31，得x＝7。","answerFormat":"single-choice","verification":{"equation":"5*(-2)-3*x=-31","root":"7","domain":"rational"},"format":"single-choice","correctOptionId":"c3","options":[{"id":"c1","text":"21/5","misconception":"把bc誤算為5x；b是x、c是3，應為3x。"},{"id":"c2","text":"-7","misconception":"把ad−bc的負號顛倒，或將−3x移項後漏除負數。"},{"id":"c3","text":"7"},{"id":"c4","text":"41/3","misconception":"把5×(−2)誤算成正10；應先得−10−3x＝−31。"}],"bankId":"linear-equations","c